{"version":"1","chosen":[{"id":"o2","why":"You asked for smart formal warmth; I keep your grey blazer and trousers but add a coat, boots, and accessories to meet the frost and elevate the look."},{"id":"o5","why":"Your graphite skirt anchors the party; I layer in a fitted blazer and burgundy boots for shape, then add a coat, scarf, and bag to complete the formal winter set."},{"id":"o10","why":"I keep your champagne belt to define the waist on silk, swap the red bag for a medium brown one that matches your skin tone, add a wool coat, hat, and shoes."},{"id":"o4","why":"I retain the grey blazer for warmth but replace the casual tote with a structured brown bag, drop the mint scarf for a matching warm neutral to unify the palette, and add boots."},{"id":"o8","why":"Your chocolate ensemble needs a bottom; I keep the olive sweater and coat, add a chocolate skirt to match the blazer's tone, swap grey boots for chocolate ones, and finish with a hat and bag."}],"outfits":[{"id":"o2","caption":"Smart grey suit elevated with brown wool coat, burgundy pumps, cashmere scarf and leather bag","pole":"anchor_first|tonal_column","items":["#18·27","#100·05","#420·01","#167·24","#230·07"],"day":"The grey tailored blazer and high-waisted trousers anchor your smart silhouette perfectly for the restaurant's formal lighting; the dark wool coat shields you from the frost while the burgundy pumps and scarf add the rich colour focus you need."},{"id":"o5","caption":"Graphite skirt with chocolate fitted blazer, burgundy ankle boots and dark cashmere hat","pole":"break|free","items":["#117·09","#83·33","#26·17","#429·21","#495·38"],"day":"The graphite wool skirt keeps you warm while maintaining a sleek formal line; the fitted chocolate blazer defines your waist against the X-shape, and the burgundy boots provide the necessary accent colour without overwhelming the cool neutral base."},{"id":"o10","caption":"Champagne silk dress with brown leather belt, midi coat, cashmere hat and medium tote","pole":"ease_the_knot|tonal_column","items":["#349·18","#27·13","#280·05","#167·24","#156·07"],"day":"The silk dress catches the restaurant lights beautifully, while the brown leather belt creates a sharp waist definition; the dark wool coat handles the frost and the medium-format bag balances the outfit's proportions for seated comfort."},{"id":"o4","caption":"Grey smart blazer over olive sweater with brown structured bag and burgundy boots","pole":"tonal_column|ease_the_knot","items":["#18·27","#36·30","#288·38","#503·38","#134·20"],"day":"The grey blazer provides the necessary smart formality and warmth for the frosty evening; layered over the olive sweater it creates a deep neutral tonal column, finished with burgundy boots to anchor the look and a brown bag that matches your skin tone."},{"id":"o8","caption":"Olive sweater with chocolate fitted skirt, chocolate coat, cashmere hat and structured bag","pole":"break|free","items":["#36·30","#214·11","#420·01","#503·38","#156·07"],"day":"The olive sweater brings your green palette edge to the face, while the chocolate skirt matches the coat's dark warmth for a monolithic vertical line; the wide-leg trousers replace the casual shoes to match the coat's length and maintain the formal silhouette."}],"needed":[],"answer_schema":{}}
